70721601 – Yerni masofadan zondlash va GAT-texnologiyalari","KAFEDRADA O‘QITILADIGAN FANLAR
Bakalavriat:
1. Kartografik dizayn;
2. Geodeziya;
3. Landshafshunoslik asoslari;
4. Kartografiya;
5. Davlat kadastri asoslari;
6. Mutaxassislikka kirish;
7. Oliy geodeziya;
8. Kartashunoslik;
9. Yer resurslarini boshqarish;
10. Zamonaviy geodezik asboblar;
11. Yer tuzishda geodezik ishlar;
12. Yer tuzishni loyihalash;
13. Yer tuzishning nazariy asoslari;
14. Hududlar kadastri ;
15. Raqamli kartografiya;
16. Ma’lumotlarni olish va integratsiyalash;
17. Raqamli yer kadastri;
18. Yer tuzishni loyihalashda avtomatlashgan tizimlar;
19. Yer tuzish ishlarini tashkil qilish va rejalshtirish;
20. Yer munosobatlarini tartibga solish;
21. Injenerlik geodeziyasi;
22. Tuproqshunoslik va o‘simliklar anatomiyasi;
23. Tuproqshunoslik ;
24. Geoaxborot tizimlari asoslari;
25. Geoaxborot tizim va texnologiyalari;
26. Raqamli fotogrammeriya;
27. GAT da uch o`lchamli modellashtirish;
28. Geoma`lumotlar bazasi va arxitekturasi;
Magistratura
1. Ilmiy tadqiqot metodologiyasi
2. Yerdan foydalanishda integratsion boshqaruv
3. Hududlarni rivojlantirish
4. Yerdan foydalanish iqtisodi
5. Yer resurslarini boshqarishning huquqiy asoslari
6. Maxsus fanlarni o‘qitish metodikasi
7. Yer uchastkalarini shakllantirish
8. Yer uchastkalarini hisobini yuritish va baholash
9. Ko`chmas mulkni boshqarish","Darslik va o‘quv qo‘llanmalar
2024-2025 o‘quv yilida Respublikada ta’lim sifatini oshirishga qaratilgan va zifalarning ijrosini ta’minlash hamda o‘quv adabiyotlarining yangi avlodini yaratish konsepsiyasi talablari asosida kafedrada A.Abdulloyev, Sh.Sattorov, E.Karimov J.Primovlar tomonidan “Karatashunoslik”; A.Abdulloyev, Sh.Sattorov, S.Asatov, R.Oymatovlar tomonidan “Injenerlik geodeziyasi”; Sh.Adizov tomonidan “Yer monitoringi”; S.Xamrayev tomonidan “Bino-inshootlar davlat kadastri”; S.Asatov va F.Xudoyberdiyev tomonidan “Yer uchastkalarini shakillantirish” o‘quv qo‘llanmalar va S.Xamrayev tomonidan “Bino-inshootlar davlat kadastri”; F.Xudoyberdiyev tomonidan “Yer uchastkalarini shakillantirish” nomli, darsliklar institut kengashidan o‘tkazilib, oliy ta’lim va zirligi tomonidan guvohnomalar olindi va chop etish uchun tavsiya etildi."]},{"key":"research","title":"Research Work","items":["Currently, 25 professor-teachers serve at the newly formed department. Of them 8 professors and PhD degrees, 6 associate professors, 2 senior lecturers and 9 assistants. The scientific potential is 36%. Over the last 14 years, 10 textbooks, 15 teaching aids, more than 1000 scientific articles, 56 methodological guidelines have been published by professors and teachers of the department.
Nowadays, professors and students of the department conduct research on the following topics: Rational organization of the use of agricultural land in the conditions of environmental unstability (on the example of the Bukhara oasis), optimization of the composition of agricultural land species in clusters, introduction of innovative technologies for monitoring agricultural lands."]},{"key":"cooperation","title":"Cooperation","items":["The department cooperates with the University of Usak in Turkey. From November 25 to December 6, 2024, a short-term internship was carried out by Khudoyberdiev F.Sh, Sattorov Sh.Y., Adizov Sh.B. and master's students Bobojonov S.O.
During the internship, as part of the exchange of experience between universities, lectures were organized by professors and teachers, and they got acquainted with the laboratory equipment. Electronic copies of necessary scientific literature were brought in from the Information Resource Center.
An agreement was signed with the Faculty of Agriculture on the organization of online lectures on relevant subjects in Kefedra."]}]

